---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="About Us — Joyo Digitama Solusi"
  description="Learn about Joyo Digitama Solusi — a software company based in Malang, Indonesia specializing in industrial IoT, custom development, and SaaS products."
  path="about"
>
  <!-- Page Hero -->
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="section-tag">// about us</span>
      <h1>About <span class="phosphor">Joyo Digitama</span> Solusi</h1>
      <p>Empowering businesses through innovative software solutions and industrial digitalization</p>
      <div class="stats-row">
        <div class="stat reveal">
          <div class="stat-value">20+</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Projects Delivered</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat reveal">
          <div class="stat-value">5+</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Years Experience</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat reveal">
          <div class="stat-value">10+</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Industries Served</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Mission & Vision -->
  <section>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <span class="section-tag">// what drives us</span>
        <h2>Mission &amp; Vision</h2>
        <p>What drives us forward every day</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mv-grid">
        <div class="mv-card mission reveal">
          <span class="mv-label">// Our Mission</span>
          <h3>Mission</h3>
          <p>To empower businesses with innovative software solutions that drive efficiency, growth, and digital transformation across industries.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mv-card vision reveal">
          <span class="mv-label">// Our Vision</span>
          <h3>Vision</h3>
          <p>To be the leading provider of industrial digitalization solutions in Southeast Asia, known for quality, innovation, and client success.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Core Values -->
  <section>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <span class="section-tag">// principles</span>
        <h2>Our Core Values</h2>
        <p>The principles that guide everything we build</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cards-grid">
        <div class="card reveal">
          <div class="card-icon green"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9.663 17h4.673M12 3v1m6.364 1.636l-.707.707M21 12h-1M4 12H3m3.343-5.657l-.707-.707m2.828 9.9a5 5 0 117.072 0l-.548.547A3.374 3.374 0 0014 18.469V19a2 2 0 11-4 0v-.531c0-.895-.356-1.754-.988-2.386l-.548-.547z"/></svg></div>
          <h3>Innovation First</h3>
          <p>We push boundaries and embrace new technologies to deliver cutting-edge solutions.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card reveal">
          <div class="card-icon blue"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 00-4-4H5a4 4 0 00-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 00-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 010 7.75"/></svg></div>
          <h3>Client-Centric</h3>
          <p>Your success is our priority. We build solutions tailored to your unique challenges.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card reveal">
          <div class="card-icon purple"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polyline points="16 18 22 12 16 6"/><polyline points="8 6 2 12 8 18"/></svg></div>
          <h3>Quality Excellence</h3>
          <p>We maintain the highest standards in code quality, testing, and delivery.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card reveal">
          <div class="card-icon orange"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M2 20h20"/><path d="M5 20V8l7-5 7 5v12"/><rect x="9" y="12" width="6" height="8"/></svg></div>
          <h3>Industry Expertise</h3>
          <p>Deep domain knowledge in manufacturing, IoT, and industrial automation.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Logo Meaning -->
  <section>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <span class="section-tag">// symbolism</span>
        <h2>Our Logo</h2>
        <p>The Joyo Digitama logo combines J and D (Joyo + Digitama) into a single mark, representing the fusion of business identity and digital transformation.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal">
        <div class="logo-meaning-grid">
          <div class="logo-display">
            <img src="/images/logo-joyodigitama.svg" alt="Joyo Digitama Logo" />
          </div>
          <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:24px;">
            <div class="logo-card">
              <div class="card-head">
                <div class="card-num">1</div>
                <div>
                  <h3>The &ldquo;J&rdquo; Core</h3>
                  <p>Represents <strong>Joyo</strong> as the company&rsquo;s identity. Positioned at the center, symbolizing that technology should serve business goals&mdash;not the other way around. The solid vertical structure conveys <strong>stability</strong> and <strong>reliability</strong>.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="logo-card">
              <div class="card-head">
                <div class="card-num">2</div>
                <div>
                  <h3>The &ldquo;D&rdquo; Outer Curve</h3>
                  <p>Represents <strong>Digitama</strong> / Digital Transformation. The expanding arc symbolizes growth, scalability, business transformation, and continuous improvement. It creates a feeling of <strong>movement forward</strong> rather than a static emblem.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="logo-card">
              <div class="card-head">
                <div class="card-num">3</div>
                <div>
                  <h3>Pixel Blocks</h3>
                  <p>The small squares at the upper-left represent data points, IoT devices, digital signals, and system integration. The transition from <strong>pixels into a smooth curve</strong> communicates: <em>&ldquo;Turning raw data into business value.&rdquo;</em></p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:32px;margin-top:48px;" class="reveal">
        <div class="color-card">
          <div class="color-swatch">
            <div class="swatch" style="background:#00ff88;"></div>
            <h3>Bright Green</h3>
          </div>
          <p>Represents innovation, technology, growth, efficiency, and sustainability. Maintains continuity with existing brand recognition while signaling a modern, forward-thinking approach.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="color-card">
          <div class="color-swatch">
            <div class="swatch" style="background:#0f1e23;border-color:rgba(0,255,136,0.15);"></div>
            <h3>Dark Background</h3>
          </div>
          <p>Represents enterprise software, industrial environments, professionalism, and high-tech positioning. This combination is common among modern SaaS and industrial software because it feels premium without being overly corporate.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal interpretation-card">
        <h3>Strategic Brand Interpretation</h3>
        <p>&ldquo;We transform operational data into digital intelligence. The pixels represent raw industrial data, the flowing curves represent digital transformation, and the integrated J-D mark symbolizes the connection between business operations and technology.&rdquo;</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Timeline -->
  <section>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <span class="section-tag">// milestones</span>
        <h2>Our Journey</h2>
        <p>Key milestones since our founding</p>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline reveal">
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <div class="timeline-year">2025</div>
          <div class="timeline-title">Founded</div>
          <div class="timeline-desc">Joyo Digitama Solusi established in Malang, Indonesia</div>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <div class="timeline-year">2025</div>
          <div class="timeline-title">Cowculator Launch</div>
          <div class="timeline-desc">Dairy farm management and feed composition optimization</div>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <div class="timeline-year">2026</div>
          <div class="timeline-title">Revklik Launch</div>
          <div class="timeline-desc">Digital marketing platform for modern businesses</div>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <div class="timeline-year">2026</div>
          <div class="timeline-title">E-Pondok Launch</div>
          <div class="timeline-desc">Islamic boarding school management system</div>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <div class="timeline-year">2026</div>
          <div class="timeline-title">AndonFAST Launch</div>
          <div class="timeline-desc">Digital manufacturing solution for factory operations and production monitoring</div>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <div class="timeline-year">2026</div>
          <div class="timeline-title">Voltrus Launch</div>
          <div class="timeline-desc">Lightweight SCADA &amp; industrial monitoring platform for system integrators</div>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <div class="timeline-year">2026</div>
          <div class="timeline-title">Waqtu Launch</div>
          <div class="timeline-desc">Prayer times menu bar app for Muslim professionals on macOS</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Selected Work -->
  <section>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <span class="section-tag">// selected work</span>
        <h2>CMS &amp; Landing Page Experience</h2>
        <p>A sample of content platforms and landing pages we've designed and shipped for clients</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cards-grid">
        <div class="card reveal">
          <div class="card-icon green"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/><line x1="9" y1="13" x2="15" y2="13"/><line x1="9" y1="17" x2="13" y2="17"/></svg></div>
          <h3>dwitriyono.com</h3>
          <p>Custom CMS and editorial platform for an Islamic dakwah &amp; kajian brand. Structured article publishing with reader analytics, embedded video library, and an interactive activity feed &mdash; all managed by the author without touching code.</p>
          <div class="tags">
            <span class="tag green">Custom CMS</span>
            <span class="tag green">Editorial</span>
            <span class="tag green">SEO</span>
            <span class="tag green">TanStack Start</span>
          </div>
          <a href="https://dwitriyono.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="View live: dwitriyono.com" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin-top:20px;color:var(--phosphor);font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.8125rem;font-weight:500;">
            View live
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="card reveal">
          <div class="card-icon blue"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M18 10h-1.26A8 8 0 1 0 9 20h9a5 5 0 0 0 0-10z"/><line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12" y2="16"/><line x1="8" y1="12" x2="16" y2="12"/></svg></div>
          <h3>mx.opexcg.com</h3>
          <p>Marketing landing page and product site for OpexMX, a people-first CMMS for maintenance teams. Conversion-focused copy, pricing tiers, feature storytelling, and an AI/MCP integration showcase for a B2B SaaS audience.</p>
          <div class="tags">
            <span class="tag blue">Landing Page</span>
            <span class="tag blue">B2B SaaS</span>
            <span class="tag blue">Conversion</span>
            <span class="tag blue">Next.js</span>
          </div>
          <a href="https://mx.opexcg.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="View live: mx.opexcg.com" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin-top:20px;color:var(--cyan);font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.8125rem;font-weight:500;">
            View live
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Leadership -->
  <section>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <span class="section-tag">// team</span>
        <h2>Leadership</h2>
        <p>The people driving our vision</p>
      </div>
      <div class="leadership-card reveal">
        <img src="/images/dzulfikar.webp" alt="Dzulfikar Ats Tsauri - CEO & Founder of Joyo Digitama Solusi" class="leadership-avatar" width="80" height="80" />
        <h3>Dzulfikar Ats Tsauri</h3>
        <div class="leadership-role">CEO &amp; Founder</div>
        <p class="bio">Industrial automation engineer turned software entrepreneur. Building digital solutions for real-world industrial challenges.</p>
        <div class="leadership-socials">
          <a href="https://dzulfikar.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" title="Personal Site" aria-label="Personal Site">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="2" y1="12" x2="22" y2="12"/><path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z"/></svg>
          </a>
